BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Fall Photo Contest\, McCormick's Creek State Park
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261031T000000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261031T120000
UID:404dddbc5f889fb81614270788742166@events.in.gov
DESCRIPTION:McCormick&rsquo\;s Creek Fall Photo Contest McCormick&#39\;s C
 reek seeks your help in gathering photos of the fall splendor at the park 
 by participating in our Fall Photo Contest.&nbsp\;The winning prize is a 2
 027 State Parks Annual Entrance Pass!&nbsp\;&nbsp\; To enter\, please send
  the following information in an email to &nbsp\; Jfiler@dnr.IN.gov &nbsp\
 ;from Oct. 1\, 2026&ndash\;Nov. 14\, 2026 : Photo (attached as a jpeg\, jp
 g\, png) Participant name Address Date the photo was taken The winner will
  be selected by a panel of DNR staff\, and the entries will be shared on t
 he McCormick&rsquo\;s Creek Facebook page after the contest.&nbsp\; &nbsp\
 ; Contest Rules: NO PURCHASE NECESSARY TO ENTER OR WIN. ALL FEDERAL\, STAT
 E\, LOCAL\, AND MUNICIPAL LAWS AND REGULATIONS APPLY. VOID WHERE PROHIBITE
 D. 1. Eligibility: This contest is open to legal residents of the fifty (5
 0) United States and the District of Columbia at the time of entry. Employ
 ees of the Indiana Department of Resources and other companies associated 
 with the promotion of this contest and their respective parents\, subsidia
 ries\, affiliates and advertising and promotion agencies as well as the im
 mediate family (spouse\, parents\, siblings and children) and household me
 mbers of each such employee are not eligible. 2. Sponsor: This contest is 
 sponsored by the Indiana Department of Natural Resources (&ldquo\;Sponsor&
 rdquo\;). 3. All photos must have been created at McCormick&rsquo\;s Creek
  State Park property.&nbsp\; 4. Agreement of Rules: Participation in this 
 contest constitutes entrants full and unconditional agreement to and accep
 tance of these rules and the decisions of the Sponsor\, which are final an
 d binding. Winning a prize is contingent on being compliant with these rul
 es and fulfilling all other requirements set forth herein. 5. Contest Peri
 od: The contest begins on October 1\, 2026\, and the deadline to submit th
 e winter photo entries is 11:59 E.T. on November 14\, 2026. Entries that a
 re submitted before or after the contest period will be disqualified. Subm
 issions will be accepted for the duration of the contest using the online 
 method only. 6. How to Enter: Online will be the only method of entry that
  is available\, it is available through&nbsp\;by email to&nbsp\; Jfiler@dn
 r.in.gov &nbsp\;and must follow the specific directions when filling out t
 he entry and submitting. All entries will become the property of the Spons
 or and will not be returned. 7. Prize: Winner will be chosen by a panel of
  Sponsor&rsquo\;s employees and will win a prize. The potential winner sha
 ll be selected from all eligible entries received. The Sponsor will notify
  the winner within two weeks of the end of the contest. If the potential w
 inner cannot be contacted within five (5) days after first contact the Spo
 nsor may select an alternate winner in his/her place from the remaining no
 n-winning\, eligible entries. The prize is: 2027 Annual Entrance Pass&nbsp
 \; 8. Winner Notification: Winners will be notified via email and announce
 d via social media. 9. Release and Limitations of Liability: By participat
 ing in the contest\, entrants agree to release and hold harmless the Spons
 or\, and each of their respective parents\, subsidiaries\, affiliates\, ad
 vertising and promotional agencies\, other companies associated with the c
 ontest and each of their respective officers\, directors\, employees\, sha
 reholders\, representatives and agents from and against any claim or cause
  of action arising out of the participation in this contest or receipt or 
 use of prize. 10. Disputes: Except where prohibited\, each entrant agrees 
 that any and all disputes\, claims and causes of action arising out of\, o
 r connected with\, the contest or any prize awarded shall be resolved indi
 vidually\, without resort to any form of class action\, and exclusively by
  the appropriate court located in Indiana. 11. Privacy Policy: Information
  collected from entrants is subject to Sponsor&rsquo\;s privacy policy. Ph
 otos of the entered may be used in contest promotions and general communic
 ations\, including the DNR/State Park social media pages\, newsletters\, a
 nd websites.
LOCATION:McCormick's Creek State Park\, 250 McCormick's Creek Park Road\, 
 Spencer\, IN 47460
URL:on.IN.gov/mccormickscreek
X-SOURCE:McCormick's Creek State Park
END:VEVENT
