BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Fossil Discovery and Geology Hike\, McCormick's Creek State Park
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261112T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261112T153000
UID:f0371da712cb724f86cf63492be085ee@events.in.gov
DESCRIPTION:2 pm: Fossil Discovery and Geology Hike- (Hike) Take a trip ba
 ck in time to when Indiana was an ocean floor! Learn about ancient creatur
 es from the skeletons they left behind in the limestone. Join Naturalist J
 essica on a rugged hike on Trail 3. We will scrabble through rocks in the 
 creek to learn about fossils older than dinosaurs and how the canyon was f
 ormed and altered over geological history. We begin our 0.8-mile hike in f
 ront of the Canyon Inn.
LOCATION:McCormick's Creek State Park\, Canyon Inn\, 250 McCormick's Creek
  Park Road\, Spencer\, IN 47460
URL:https://events.in.gov/event/fossil-discovery-and-geology-hike-mccormic
 ks-creek-state-park-1725
X-SOURCE:McCormick's Creek State Park
END:VEVENT
