SUMMARY:Wolf Cave Hike\, McCormick's Creek State Park
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261113T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261113T123000
UID:467f7ba1cb73c3d794b12e7de5bde35c@events.in.gov
DESCRIPTION:Friday\, Nov 13th 10 am-12:30 pm: Wolf Cave Hike- (Hike) Spend
  Friday\, 13 th in a cave with the naturalist! This hike is 2.8 miles and 
 will have the option to go through Wolf Cave. Please bring a flashlight an
 d wear close-toed shoes. Wolf Cave is wet and has tight spaces! We will be
 gin this hike at the Nature Center .
LOCATION:McCormick's Creek State Park\, Nature Center\, 250 McCormick's Cr
 eek Park Road\, Spencer\, IN 47460
URL:on.in.gov/mccormickscreek
X-SOURCE:McCormick's Creek State Park
END:VEVENT
