BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Lovely Lichen\, McCormick's Creek State Park
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261114T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261114T113000
UID:b7ab622f98c10b9fb590a5bdbde390dc@events.in.gov
DESCRIPTION:Saturday\, Nov 14th 10 am: Lovely Lichen- (Hike) On this hike 
 we learn about the symbiotic relationships lichen have with the trees they
  grow on. Lichen powers the food web in rocky environments like on trial 2
 . We will be hiking in tornado impact area to learn about lichen. Meet Nat
 uralist Jessie at Friendly Shelter.
LOCATION:McCormick's Creek State Park\, Friendly Shelter\, 250 McCormick's
  Creek Park Road\, Spencer\, IN 47460
URL:on.in.gov/mccormickscreek
X-SOURCE:McCormick's Creek State Park
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
