DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261114T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261114T143000
UID:d23f9d96ea37f16fc7268b2408ed7465@events.in.gov
DESCRIPTION:2 pm: Indentitree - (Hike) Join Naturalist Jessie in front of 
 Centennial Shelter to take a short hike to learn tree Identification.
LOCATION:McCormick's Creek State Park\, Centennial Shelter\, 250 McCormick
 's Creek Park Road\, Spencer\, IN 47460
URL:on.in.gov/mccormickscreek
X-SOURCE:McCormick's Creek State Park
