DESCRIPTION:Sunday\, November 22nd 4 pm: Wild Turkey- (Craft) Come learn w
 hy Ben Franklin believed the wild turkey should have been our symbolic nat
 ional bird. Make a wild turkey suncatcher at the Nature Center by using me
 lted crayon shavings to celebrate the uniquely beautiful feathers of this 
 native bird. &nbsp\;
